<title>USA: AMBAC qualifies one muni bond issue for insurance.</title>
<headline>AMBAC qualifies one muni bond issue for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMBAC Indemnity Corp said that it qualified for bond insurance the following municipal bond issue scheduled for competitive sale on Monday.</p>
<p>--Delaware Valley School District, $21.79 million,direct purchase.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
